    the diagnosis code of Cy is "Q78.0".
    rn expects answers [].
    rn_in expects answers ["claim 1 is reasonable and necessary in first coast", "claim 1 is reasonable and necessary in wps", "claim 1 is reasonable and necessary in palmetto"].

